    "make_it":  [
                    "Heat the olive oil in a large skillet and brown 4.9 pounds of 93/7 ground beef with the chopped onion and green bell peppers, then drain. Season with the salt and black pepper.",
                    "Stir in the tomato paste and let it cook a minute to deepen, then add the diced tomatoes, tomato sauce, beef broth, garlic, italian seasoning, Worcestershire sauce, and paprika.",
